      "content": "Wait, granite bedrock? I thought the survey mentioned something about the soil composition being a bit tricky due to the coastal silt and potential for liquefaction during seismic shifts. Can you double check that? I don't want the zoning board catching us off guard if they've already seen the preliminary geotechnical reports.",
